<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>우리 동네 안심 안전 지도</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" />
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      height: 100%;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
      background: #f5f7f6;
      color: #17211d;
    }
    .app {
      height: 100%;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 360px 1fr;
    }
    .panel {
      padding: 18px 16px 24px;
      overflow: auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-right: 1px solid #dbe3de;
    }
    h1 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0; }
    .sub { margin: 6px 0 14px; color: #5b6b64; font-size: 13px; }
    .row, .filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    button, select, input, textarea {
      font: inherit;
      padding: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #cfd8d3;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fff;
    }
    button { cursor: pointer; }
    button.active, .submit {
      background: #1f7a5c;
      color: #fff;
      border-color: #1f7a5c;
    }
    form { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    #map { height: 100%; min-height: 280px; }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid #dbe3de;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .hint { color: #66756e; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; }
    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .route { background: #e8f5ee; color: #1f7a5c; }
    .store { background: #fff1e4; color: #c56a1a; }
    .safe { background: #e7f1f8; color: #1d5f8a; }
    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .app { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: 46% 54%; }
      .panel { border-right: 0; border-top: 1px solid #dbe3de; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app">
    <aside class="panel">
      <h1>우리 동네 안심 안전 지도</h1>
      <p class="sub">도봉구 · 안심 귀갓길 · 24시 편의점 · 치안 우수 지역</p>

      <div class="row">
        <button id="share-btn" type="button">이 사이트 링크 복사</button>
      </div>

      <div class="filters">
        <button class="chip active" data-filter="all" type="button">전체</button>
        <button class="chip" data-filter="route" type="button">안심 귀갓길</button>
        <button class="chip" data-filter="store" type="button">24시 편의점</button>
        <button class="chip" data-filter="safe" type="button">치안 우수</button>
      </div>

      <form id="report-form">
        <select id="category">
          <option value="route">안심 귀갓길</option>
          <option value="store">24시 편의점</option>
          <option value="safe">치안 우수 지역</option>
        </select>
        <input id="name" required placeholder="장소 이름" />
        <textarea id="address" required placeholder="설명. 지도를 클릭해서 위치를 찍으세요."></textarea>
        <input id="nickname" placeholder="닉네임(선택)" />
        <div class="hint" id="coord-hint">지도를 클릭하면 위치가 저장됩니다. 집 주소는 쓰지 마세요.</div>
        <input type="hidden" id="lat" />
        <input type="hidden" id="lng" />
        <button class="submit" type="submit">제보하기</button>
      </form>

      <div id="list"></div>
    </aside>
    <div id="map"></div>
  </div>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"></script>
